orthant 1 language

- # `↯/s.15.1` — `Error.Unchecked`
+ # `↯/s.15.1` — `Error.Unchecked`

- Raised when a non-Soundness `Throwable` must be wrapped as an
- `Error`.
+ Levée lorsqu'un `Throwable` étranger à Soundness doit être enveloppé dans une `Error`.

- ## Cause
+ ## Cause

- `Error.apply(throwable)` either passes through an existing `Error`
- or wraps a foreign throwable in `Error.Unchecked`. The wrapper
- preserves the original message (or notes its absence) and the
- stack trace from the original throwable.
+ `Error.apply(throwable)` laisse passer une `Error` existante, ou enveloppe un throwable étranger
+ dans `Error.Unchecked`. L'enveloppe conserve le message d'origine (ou signale son absence) et la
+ trace de pile du throwable d'origine.

- ## Example messages
+ ## Exemples de messages

= ## Example messages
=
- ```
+ ```

- [↯/s.15.1] unchecked error with message, NullPointerException
+ [↯/s.15.1] unchecked error with message, NullPointerException

= [↯/s.15.1] unchecked error with message, NullPointerException
